  "body": "CENTRAL-21 now has an independently supported practical partition. Preserve `Columbia_Blood_Agar_Base` / `UNMAPPED_0118`, its generic UNMAPPED scope and all authentic history. Author one genuine same-path dependent correction from maintained beforeimage `29ed63a00d3f4f7a1652beee549526d625eef231f29b40691bd128d2f7608324`: retain the two vendor alias texts and sources as nonresolving historical `REJECTED_LABEL` entries with truthful partition notes/history. Do not repurpose the entire mixed owner as a vendor product or fabricate a maintained preimage for a new destination.\n\nThe exact BD-Difco alias and three positively supported dry-base occurrences can be routed to the existing seven-input Difco nominal candidate. Generic providercompound2046 is not globally identified. Oxoid source300/921 support one nominal four-input candidate; source300 retains literal variable quantity and its CM0331 catalogue, while source921 states39g without a historical catalogue assertion. Four older CM331 occurrences specify1L prepared base before blood and remain preparation-identity holds; do not substitute dry-powder quantities. All original source membership and separate Columbia products remain.\n\nThe accountable worker must publish the authentic existing-owner dependency and bind its actual reviewed after hash to supported vendor successors. This is implementation of the existing BIO-F06/BIO-F07 finding, not a new blanket identity approval. No maintained application or role/export approval occurred.\n\nEvidence: `workers/w07/worktree/.temp/columbia-continuity-independent-v1/`, handoff `262baa33bb32dc864e4a5d3da6bef1dc9a58fc23f18696e3436b9c7d102a84d9`, manifest `9b4e4bdde13e226fecf3dc04fde7b65aa3b37afbbb82ed16b3720c7131ce6463`; coordinator rehashed all2358 members. Independent Columbia scientific and skeptical reviewers read the current owner, seven source rows and three vendor relationships. The report-only evidence-kind correction and predecessors remain preserved; nati